e/upload/t_thumb/sczk7a.jpg"}, {"id": 1659140, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczk78.jpg"}], "slug": "83", "storyline": "1983 was a tense year for global politics. With Western powers ramping up anti-Soviet rhetoric and the Soviets responding in kind, it represented one of the most dangerous years in the 20th century.\n\nIn \u201883, these tensions explode into a global conflict where \u2018what if\u2019 has become \u2018when\u2019. Birthed from the timeline of the real Cold War, sabre-rattling escalates to a World War for dominance between two nuclear superpowers.", "summary": "'83 is a 40v40 squad based, objective focused online tactical first person shooter set in a Cold-War-Gone-Hot scenario currently in development at Blue Dot Games.\n\nPlayers will have access to a selection of real-world infantry weapons and equipment, as well as a selection of powerful land vehicles which can decisively turn the tide of a battle.\n\nIt's designed with 'accessible realism' for the most enjoyable, but still hardcore experience that gets you to the action fast, without losing the lethality of war", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/83", "videos": [{"id": 25495, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "1u9oyFkXca4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1u9oyFkXca4", "title": "'83 - Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1u9oyFkXca4/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 115987, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "l6Is2JRWLnU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6Is2JRWLnU", "title": "83 trailer - PC Gaming Show 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/l6Is2JRWLnU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 164553, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "3iGU_FMjbY8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3iGU_FMjbY8", "title": "'83 - Official Re-Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3iGU_FMjbY8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 164554, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "vxEBWaatcpE", "url"